<title>USA: Banyan Systems sees Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>Banyan Systems sees Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBORO, Mass. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Systems Inc said Friday it expects to report a net loss for the first quarter of $5.5-$6.5 million, or $0.32-$0.38 a share.</p>
<p>The company said it expects revenues of $20-$21 million.</p>
